# CKKS-Fed Experiment Report / 实验报告

**Experiment Mode / 实验模式:** CKKS-Fed (Encrypted) / 加密模式  
**Timestamp / 时间戳:** 20260621_191848  
**Output Directory / 输出目录:** `accuracy_baseline/maser/result_fix_pro\experiment_20260621_191848_mnist`  

